# Katna service, English: messages Katna Mail shows from the service.
# Guide: i18n/README.md. Keep ids stable; change the text freely.
# In plural forms, write { $count } rather than the digit, so languages
# with their own digits show them.

## Errors Katna Mail shows

# Adding an account failed because Settings > Delete all data is running.
daemon-deleting-data = Katna is deleting all its data

## The page the browser shows after signing in with Google or Microsoft
## ($provider is "Google" or "Microsoft")

daemon-signed-in = You are signed in to { $provider }. You can close this tab and go back to Katna.
daemon-sign-in-failed = Katna is not signed in to { $provider }. You can close this tab and try again in Katna.
